Z||000000||Haze_Performance||08-26-2000||04:21 AM||||I was driving down I55 today and I saw a Fiero a few cars ahead of me. It was a red Formula with a GT fastback in primer. I caught up to it on the drivers side and it had a Holley type side scoop on it. He was tying to merge left to take the Joliet exit. When he started to turn onto the exit I passed him (I was still on I55) Now for the Rare part.He had a the same Holley type scoop on the pass. side. It was such a clean job it looked stock. I turned around and tried to find him but no luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> . Has anyone know or ever seen this guy before??<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">  <B>My 1985 2M4 Sport Coupe </B><P><BR><B>My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A></B>||||reg||4
